<section class="hero">
  <h1>Run your own server in a minute</h1>
  <p>Pick a name, press Start, and your players join by typing that name on the login screen. Everyone connects to the same address, so there is nothing for them to set up per server.</p>
  <p class="actions">
    <a class="button" href="/signup">Create an account</a>
    <a class="button ghost" href="/login">Log in</a>
  </p>
